SUMMARY:Call to Artists! Night Market at the Pence
DESCRIPTION:Call to Artists! Night Market at the Pence\nEvent date: June 12\, 6-9 PM\nApplication deadline: May 24\, 5 PM \nOur Night Market is back on June 12\, 6-9 PM! The Pence’s Night Market is a pop-up market during the 2nd Friday ArtAbout that invites young visual artists\, ages 16-25\, to display and sell their work inside the gallery\, ranging from prints and paintings\, to ceramics and jewelry. \nIt’s free to apply\, and applications are due on May 24 by 5 PM. Accepted artists will be required to pay a $35 participation fee (free for Pence Members). For the event\, artists must bring their own table to display their artwork\, but the Pence will provide chairs. All art sales are handled by participants\, and all proceeds go directly to the artist. \nLearn more: https://pencegallery.org/events/night-market/\nApply here: bit.ly/pencenightmarket \nInterested in becoming a Pence Member? Student memberships are only $35/year! If you sign up\, that means no participation fee for the Night Market\, and you’ll receive other perks and benefits for an entire year such as discounts on gift store purchases and lower workshop fees\, invitations to Members-only events\, and more. Join at the Pence or at https://pencegallery.org/support/membership/. \nAny questions? Email Katharine Schultz at pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/call-to-artists-night-market-at-the-pence/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Community,Shopping
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Night-Market-call-4by5.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
