SUMMARY:Acme Theatre Company Presents The Importance of Being Earnest
DESCRIPTION:Everyone is in love with Earnest\, the irresistible bad boy of London society. The trouble is\, Earnest doesn’t exist! A wildly entertaining “trivial comedy for serious people\,” that sparkles with dazzling wordplay and hilariously unlikely situations\, Oscar Wilde’s most popular play has entertained theatre-goers for over a century! \nAcme Theatre Company will be putting on its production of The Importance of Being Earnest at the Davis Community Church lawn from May 22-25 (Friday\, Saturday\, Sunday\, and Monday) \n 
