SUMMARY:Watercolor Portrait Painting with Misuk Goltz
DESCRIPTION:Watercolor Portrait Painting with Misuk Goltz\nSaturday\, May 23\, 10 AM – 2:30 PM\n$120 Members\, $135 Non-Members (materials not included) \nThis watercolor portrait workshop with Misuk Goltz will teach you how to mix skin tones and develop a layering process to capture a subject’s likeness and character. Students will explore an expressive style rather than realistic perfection\, focusing on facial structure\, features\, and shadows. Through hands-on demonstrations\, you’ll be guided until your portrait comes to life. Portrait painting experience isn’t necessary\, but participants should be familiar with the basics of drawing and watercolor painting. \nRegister at https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/. \nQuestions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/watercolor-portrait-painting-with-misuk-goltz/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
